            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "blk_mvylvt2e_dug87",
                "type": "solo-text",
                "data": {
                  "paragraphs": [
                    {
                      "text": "If you are here, I assume you’ve just read &amp; are familiar with the Scroll of Sender Authentication Package. Otherwise, feel free to check said knowledge and then come back to this one 😎.",
                      "align": "left"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ],
            "showTitle": true,
            "titleMode": "custom",
            "title": {
              "text": "<br>",
              "align": "left"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_mvylzjej_kcyfu",
          "type": "callout",
          "data": {
            "calloutType": "note",
            "text": {
              "text": "",
              "align": "left"
            },
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "blk_mvylzjej_vr4kl",
                "type": "solo-text",
                "data": {
                  "paragraphs": [
                    {
                      "text": "<span class=\"article-text-purple\">SSL</span><span class=\"article-text-purple\"></span> certificates keep online interactions private and they give visitors the confidence to transact with your website. SSL validates site identity and encrypt data in transit.",
                      "align": "left"
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "When a website is secured by an <span class=\"article-text-purple\">SSL</span> certificate, the <span class=\"article-text-custom-color\" style=\"--coven-custom-text-color:#EE2098\">HTTPS</span><span class=\"article-text-custom-color\" style=\"--coven-custom-text-color:#EE2098\"></span> (Hypertext Transfer Protocol Secure) is displayed in the URL.",
                      "align": "left"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ],
            "showTitle": true,
            "titleMode": "custom",
            "title": {
              "text": "What are Secure Sockets Layer (SSL)?",
              "align": "left"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_mvym28pj_1lbez",
          "type": "solo-text",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              {
                "text": "More than a recommendation, it is a mandatory requirement to enable SSLs after the SAP has been implemented. These security layers wrap around the following subdomains in SFMC: click, cloud, image and view. To illustrate:",
                "align": "left"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_mvym5qxl_ue8sm",
          "type": "card-grid-2",
          "data": {
            "card1Icon": "◈",
            "card1Title": {
              "text": "<strong><u><span class=\"article-text-purple\">click</span></u></strong>.email.covenoftechnology.cloud",
              "align": "left"
            },
            "card1Desc": {
              "text": "Secures and tracks hyperlinks on <span class=\"article-text-bg-purple\">click engagement</span>",
              "align": "left"
            },
            "card2Icon": "◈",
            "card2Title": {
              "text": "<strong><u><span class=\"article-text-purple\">cloud</span></u></strong>.email.covenoftechnology.cloud",
              "align": "left"
            },
            "card2Desc": {
              "text": "Secures <span class=\"article-text-bg-purple\">CloudPage</span> (landing pages) hyperlinks built in SFMC",
              "align": "left"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_mvym6abk_9qzn0",
          "type": "card-grid-2",
          "data": {
            "card1Icon": "◈",
            "card1Title": {
              "text": "<strong><u><span class=\"article-text-purple\">image</span></u></strong>.email.covenoftechnology.cloud",
              "align": "left"
            },
            "card1Desc": {
              "text": "Secures hyperlinks on <span class=\"article-text-bg-purple\">content</span> stored in SFMC (Content Builder)",
              "align": "left"
            },
            "card2Icon": "◈",
            "card2Title": {
              "text": "<strong><u><span class=\"article-text-purple\">view</span></u></strong>.email.covenoftechnology.cloud",
              "align": "left"
            },
            "card2Desc": {
              "text": "Secures the <span class=\"article-text-bg-purple\">View as a webpage</span> hyperlink used in email communications",
              "align": "left"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
